<title>THAILAND: Krung Thai Bank cuts prime rate to 13 pct.</title>
<headline>Krung Thai Bank cuts prime rate to 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krung Thai Bank Plc said on Wednesday it planned to cut its minimum lending rate (MLR) 25 basis points to 13.00 percent, effective December 2.</p>
<p>The third largest Thai bank said in a statement the cut was in line with a government policy to encourage private investment by reducing business funding costs after a steady decline in overall bank credit growth this year.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
</text>
